        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "时常 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "时常 describes frequent recurrence. It is neither uninterrupted continuation nor every occasion without exception.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他时常来看我。",
                "pinyin": "tā shícháng lái kàn wǒ 。",
                "meaning": "He often comes to see me.",
                "audio": "11f750b0445cee70ab790df90e2e9e0ac246d761985785df275d012a68fbe479"
              },
              {
                "text": "我时常想起这件事。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ shícháng xiǎngqǐ zhè jiàn shì 。",
                "meaning": "I often think of this matter.",
                "audio": "4b2582e5eed9f61245c205bc471f72883bcf570e7ec30b25681ddf6b69109c98"
